Full list of changes: git log df0149e3..19.0-coop

Changes
-------
2026-09-29  Removed network calls to Odoo S.A. services: publisher warranty,
            website configurator and AI text, media library, ChatGPT
            translation, odoo.com account OAuth.
2026-09-29  Removed modules depending on Odoo S.A. services, and base_vat
            (generated list: .coop/removed-modules.txt, script .coop/strip.py;
            gate: .coop/check.py).
2026-09-29  Removed links to odoo.com (support, account, upgrade, app and theme
            stores, documentation) and the digest mobile banner from the user
            interface. Copyright notices are preserved.

NO WARRANTY: see sections 15-16 of the GNU GPL v3 (included in LICENSE).

Exact source of the version running on https://daocoop.tech: tag
19.0-coop-YYYYMMDD, recorded in deploy/engine.ref of
